    "notes": {
        "caa98a2d-35a1-4083-a5f1-bb907c1d75a1": {
            "x": 64,
            "y": 848,
            "width": 720,
            "height": 260,
            "content": "## ⚠️ Test data assumptions\n\nMessages can only be sent to a real contact who talks to the connected channel, so this flow needs a prepared subscriber:\n\n1. Connect a Facebook page (Messenger) to the Manychat account.\n2. From a Facebook profile named **Appmixer E2E**, send any message to the page. The contact appears in Manychat → Contacts.\n3. Repeat step 2 **within 24 hours before each run**: Meta allows messages without a message tag only inside the 24-hour window.\n4. The account needs at least one flow (List Flows takes the first one; Send Flow starts it for the subscriber)."
        }
    }
